d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Fully furnished 21 m2 studio in the Rheingau Apartments, right next to the EBS University campus in Oestrich-Winkel — a two-minute walk to your lectures. The building was completed in 2017 and is still in near-new condition.\n\nThe flat has its own kitchen with ceramic hob, microwave and fridge, a private bathroom, a large desk, a wardrobe and a separate sleeping area. Everything you need is already there: bring a suitcase and move in.\n\nThe rent is fully inclusive. Heating, electricity, water and a fast internet flat rate are all covered, so there are no monthly utility bills and no year-end settlement. Heating comes from an on-site combined heat and power plant and the building is very energy efficient (41 kWh/m2a).\n\nShared facilities include a laundry room, bike storage and a common room on the ground floor, and almost everyone living here is an EBS student. The windows look out over the vineyards towards the Rhine.\n\nAvailable for the spring semester 2027, from 1 January to 30 June, which matches the EBS exchange calendar. A private outdoor parking space can be added for 40 EUR per month. The studio is designed for one person. You can register your address here and I will provide the Wohnungsgeberbestätigung for the Bürgeramt.\n\nHappy to show you around on a video call — just send me a message.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"0"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heati